wbt-viewshed-offsets
====================

This product contains software derived from WhiteboxTools.

`src/main.rs` began as a verbatim copy of:

    whitebox-tools-app/src/tools/terrain_analysis/viewshed.rs

from https://github.com/jblindsay/whitebox-tools at commit
3d7c73cf562b6c58d2649c37f570e3e9a90322f2, and retains that file's
visibility algorithm (the eight-facet view-angle sweep). The first commit
in this repository is that file, unmodified, so that every subsequent
change to it is visible as a diff.

Modifications are marked inline in `src/main.rs` with dated `CHANGED` /
`ADDED` marker blocks that state what changed, why, and whether the change
can alter a result. The original lines are retained, commented out, beside
each change.

